feat(home): full-bleed cinematic hero slider

Restructure the hero so each slide's image covers the entire section.
Text, CTAs and controls float on top against a tasteful left-to-right
and bottom-up dark scrim for legibility.

- Single image layer + scrim replaces the previous two-column card.
- White-on-image typography with subtle drop-shadow on the headline.
- Gold primary CTA and frosted-white secondary read on any photo.
- Controls dock to the section bottom with white-translucent styling.
- Cross-fade transition only (no scale) to keep edges clean at full-bleed.
- Responsive min-heights: 560 / 620 / 700 / 780 px.
- Drop unused tone palette; full-bleed photography now carries the mood.
